        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Denis Villeneuve, Eric Heisserer, Ted Chiang, Amy Adams, Jeremy Renner, Forest Whitaker, Louise Banks\n- Works: Arrival, Story of Your Life, The Town\n- Organizations: U.S. Army, Academy Awards\n- Topics: film adaptation, science fiction films, acting nominations\n\nFacts:\n- Ted Chiang wrote the short story \"Story of Your Life\" in 1998.\n- Jeremy Renner was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for his performance in \"The Town\" in 2010.\n- \"Arrival\" is a 2016 American science fiction film directed by Denis Villeneuve and written by Eric Heisserer.\n- \"Arrival\" is based on Ted Chiang's 1998 short story \"Story of Your Life.\"\n- \"Arrival\" stars Amy Adams, Jeremy Renner, and Forest Whitaker.\n- In \"Arrival,\" Louise Banks is a linguist enlisted by the U.S. Army to help translate communications from one of several extraterrestrial craft that appeared around the world.",
